flowchart LR
  UI[React investigator desk] --> API[FastAPI evidence API]
  API --> DB[(SQLAlchemy database)]
  API --> GRAPH[NetworkX relationship graph]
  API --> AGENT[LangGraph workflow]
  AGENT --> MCP[Read-only typed evidence tools]
  MCP --> DB
  AGENT --> MODEL[LR / RF / XGBoost]
  MODEL --> SHAP[TreeExplainer]
  AGENT -. opt-in cited hypotheses .-> LLM[Groq or Gemini]
  PRODUCER[Synthetic event producer] --> KAFKA[Redpanda / Kafka]
  KAFKA --> WORKER[Scoring worker]
  WORKER --> KAFKA
  API --> PROM[Prometheus metrics]
  PROM --> GRAF[Grafana]
